This project contains only code of our own (MIT, see LICENSE).

At runtime it uses:
  - GTK 3 and gtk-layer-shell (LGPL-2.1+), through GObject Introspection
  - GLib and Gio (LGPL-2.1+), from the same source
  - pycairo / cairo (LGPL-2.1 and MPL-1.1), for drawing the strip
  - icons from the Adwaita icon theme (CC-BY-SA 3.0 / LGPL-3):
      camera-disabled-symbolic, network-cellular-disabled-symbolic

It reads, without changing them:
  - /sys/devices/platform/custom-keys/{cam_switch,nwk_switch}, provided by the
    FuriLabs kernel driver `custom_keys`

No part of FuriOS is patched or replaced.
